.envrc

# Per-instance runtime state created by `make init INSTANCE=<name>` and the
# generated instance Makefile. `instances/<name>/Makefile` and
# `instances/<name>/WORKFLOW.md` are intentionally trackable — operators may
# want to version them. The transient state below should never be committed.
instances/*/run/
instances/*/log/

# Legacy root daemon state (PID / stdout capture) from before daemon control
# moved into per-instance Makefiles. New checkouts do not create `/run/`;
# kept here so a pre-refactor checkout's residual files don't pollute
# `git status`.
/run/
